• 2-3 years of experience with the following GCP or equivalent cloud services: Cloud Storage, DataProc, Dataflow, CloudSQL, BigQuery Experience using the Linux Command Line Experience with source code management systems.&nbsp;

• Data warehousing/data modeling experience, with a strong understanding of semantic and physical data models.

• Experience with SCRUM or Agile methodology and project management tools.&nbsp;

• Able to deliver a broad range of data engagements in areas such as Data Architecture, Data Integration, Data Analytics, Data Governance, Data Quality and BI Rep

&nbsp;

